{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lot is happening in the panda village. Discover the bustling settlement of these adorable creatures. See how hard they work, play, and laze around. Find them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 Hidden Pandas: Village is a hidden object/hidden creature game. The player's task is to find cleverly hidden fluffy pandas in a detailed, hand-drawn scene. The game's aesthetic visuals are accompanied by calming music and sound effects designed to relax the player. There is also a hint system implemented, showing where the player might have missed one of the pandas\u2014some of these cute creatures have found really good hiding places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 adorable fluffy pandas to find,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a detailed scene depicting life in the village,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >calm and pleasant music,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a hint system,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >progress saving.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657290/extras/d10a13c0de3b371e88bb55b4abdbe4b8.avif?t=1746821796\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657290/extras_big/d10a13c0de3b371e88bb55b4abdbe4b8.avif?t=1746821796 width=800 height=400 /></span></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"You found a Panda!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3657290/3fa9e02d175ffb47351e2b2bd156d072aca0d2dd.jpg"},{"name":"You found a Panda!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3657290/3fa9e02d175ffb47351e2b2bd156d072aca0d2dd.jpg"},{"name":"You found a Panda!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3657290/3fa9e02d175ffb47351e2b2bd156d072aca0d2dd.jpg"},{"name":"You